# Phase 12 Production Baseline (FROZEN)

Phase 12 is **production certified and frozen** at engine version **`PHASE12_ENGINE_VERSION = v1.0.0`**.

Treat the current implementation as the regression baseline. No booking functionality may be added to Phase 12. Journey is **production complete** through Phase 13 — **no Phase 14+**.

## Freeze contract

### Counseling Experience Selection

- Deterministic service selection only
- Catalog (frozen): `one_on_one` | `admission` | `career` | `none`
- Personalized “why this service” explanation
- Soft Continue / Not now; continue → Phase 13 Booking Orchestrator (**handoff only**; Phase 12 never exposes URLs)
- Additive `phase12*` profile fields only; prior phase outputs immutable

### Skip gate (mandatory — never bypass)

Skip Phase 12 completely if Phase 11 One-on-One escalation **or** NIAT One-on-One recommendation already occurred.

### URL ownership

- Phase 12: service recommendation + personalization only
- Phase 13: booking CTA, booking URL, booking workflow (FROZEN v1.0.0)
- Phase 12 must **never** expose booking URLs

## Guardrails (never)

Expose booking URLs; collect booking information; restart earlier phases; regenerate recommendations; compare colleges; mutate rankings/recommendations/prior outputs; use LLM routing; guarantee outcomes; force counseling/booking.

## Do not change unless

- Fixing a **verified bug** or **regression** against this baseline
- User explicitly requests a Phase 12 change with acknowledged freeze risk

